@startuml
!include style.iuml
title Dua tingkat status Lead: kategori (tetap) dan status turunan (diatur tenant)
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 12
}
rectangle "KATEGORI SISTEM\n(tetap, dibaca laporan dan logika sistem)" as ROOT #white {
  rectangle "**New**" as N #dde6fa {
    rectangle "New" as N1
    rectangle "Attempted to Contact" as N2
    rectangle "+ status lain\nbuatan tenant" as N3 #white
  }
  rectangle "**In Progress**" as P #dde6fa {
    rectangle "Connected" as P1
    rectangle "Qualifying" as P2
    rectangle "+ status lain\nbuatan tenant" as P3 #white
  }
  rectangle "**Lost**" as L #fde8e6 {
    rectangle "alasan wajib\n(daftar milik tenant)" as L1
  }
  rectangle "**Converted**" as C #dff4ea {
    rectangle "tidak ada\nstatus turunan" as C1
  }
}
N -[hidden]right-> P
P -[hidden]right-> L
L -[hidden]right-> C
legend bottom
  Status turunan = isi dropdown "Status" di halaman Lead.
  Path (New › In Progress › Converted) menampilkan **kategori** dari status yang dipilih.
  Lost dan Converted dicapai lewat **aksi** (Mark as Lost, Convert), bukan lewat dropdown.
endlegend
@enduml
